{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1343777-arcana-of-supernal-beings","id":1343777,"title":"Arcana of Supernal Beings","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-26T08:27:24-07:00","id":1343777,"title":"Arcana of Supernal Beings","content":"Regarding Supernal beings, it says that they can roll Power + Finess as their spell pool and get unlimited reach. Wouldn't this make the their powers far greater than mages, especially at Rank 3 and above, plus given the fact that they can increase their Power + Finess with essence? In theory can they just counterspell every spell that mages try to cast while casting devastating spells in return? In addition, am I wrong in assuming that Supernal beings get Arcana Attainments such as Mage Armour if they possess the appropriate Arcana?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly","name":"maryshelly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T09:38:47-07:00","id":1343788,"title":"","content":"Yup, they\u2019re badass. In theory, sure, in practice they can whiff.<br /> <br /> Sure, they get arcana attainments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T10:00:56-07:00","id":1343794,"title":"","content":"Technically speaking Counterspell is a Clash of Wills, meaning they'd roll Rank + Arcanum, which is markedly worse.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T10:41:27-07:00","id":1343800,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1343777-arcana-of-supernal-beings?p=1343794#post1343794\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Technically speaking Counterspell is a Clash of Wills, meaning they'd roll Rank + Arcanum, which is markedly worse.</div> </div> </div> </div>For balancing reason i would agree with you, but every time i had seen a clash of will with an entity with simplyfied attributes (the haunted grimoire spell for example), it was stated that the entity use power+finesse.<br /> In fact i would use rank+power to attack but the books says power+finesse, for high ranks an huge pool","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T11:01:05-07:00","id":1343811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Neos01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1343777-arcana-of-supernal-beings?p=1343800#post1343800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> For balancing reason i would agree with you, but every time i had seen a clash of will with an entity with simplyfied attributes (the haunted grimoire spell for example), it was stated that the entity use power+finesse.<br /> In fact i would use rank+power to attack but the books says power+finesse, for high ranks an huge pool</div> </div> </div> </div>That's because every single instance of CoW with an ephemeral entity in Mage has non-standard dice pool. The only time ephemeral entities have a stated generic CoW dice pool (in Werewolf 2e) it's Rank (+Influence, if an Influence is used). Whoever decided on the CoW dice pools in Mage probably thought the standard dice pool is shit, especially since none of the examples gain any duration bonuses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T11:43:09-07:00","id":1343823,"title":"","content":"Wait, I thought Supernal denizens DONT get Attainments, it was a discussion I was part of months ago! Anyone remember? was that overrulled? I think it had something to do with denizens summoning themselves or not...<br /> <br /> Another weird thing about Signs of Sorcery is that the forward copy details Supernals almost as if it was 1e?<br /> <br /> Yeah I remember werewolf saying rank + influence too. which one do some of you think works best? rank + or attribute + for supernals? Or is one better for one game than the other, like giving higher dice pools vs Mages cuz hubris?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7967-scarlet-witch","name":"Scarlet Witch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"498"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T22:04:38-07:00","id":1343921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scarlet Witch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1343777-arcana-of-supernal-beings?p=1343823#post1343823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, I thought Supernal denizens DONT get Attainments, it was a discussion I was part of months ago! Anyone remember? was that overrulled? I think it had something to do with denizens summoning themselves or not...<br /> <br /> Another weird thing about Signs of Sorcery is that the forward copy details Supernals almost as if it was 1e?<br /> <br /> Yeah I remember werewolf saying rank + influence too. which one do some of you think works best? rank + or attribute + for supernals? Or is one better for one game than the other, like giving higher dice pools vs Mages cuz hubris?</div> </div> </div> </div>Doesn't make a lot of sense for Supernal entities to summon more of themselves, but it does make sense they'd be able to utilize Sympathy and the like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-27T03:02:23-07:00","id":1343947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scarlet Witch</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1343777-arcana-of-supernal-beings?p=1343823#post1343823\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, I thought Supernal denizens DONT get Attainments, it was a discussion I was part of months ago! Anyone remember? was that overrulled? I think it had something to do with denizens summoning themselves or not...<br /> <br /> Another weird thing about Signs of Sorcery is that the forward copy details Supernals almost as if it was 1e?<br /> <br /> Yeah I remember werewolf saying rank + influence too. which one do some of you think works best? rank + or attribute + for supernals? Or is one better for one game than the other, like giving higher dice pools vs Mages cuz hubris?</div> </div> </div> </div>Looking at the other splats pools for CoW i would use Power+Rank for all ephemeral clashes, and even for other rolls","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24346-neos01","name":"Neos01","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24346_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1021"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T18:10:44-08:00","id":1345681,"title":"","content":"I think the instances that call out for special CoW dice pools do so because otherwise rolling just Rank would be insufficient. But rolling Rank+Arcanum for CoW from spells or counter spells clashing seems pretty in line with a Mage's pool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12673-ew-matias","name":"EW-Matias","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"245"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}